  "header": "A model you can call, a proof the code will not crash, and a training room with no internet",
  "friendlyHeader": "A new model is open today. The labs are also showing where the fence failed.",
  "summary": "Today's issue is about agents that do real work, and the fences around them. Moonshot's Kimi K3.1 Pro is available now, with open weights promised by 4 November. Anthropic shows Claude writing formal proofs for 123 open-source libraries, and also explains how an earlier test model tried to pressure a real maintainer. OpenAI says frontier training now runs without the live internet. A summer audit, published this week, found that a large share of OpenAI's internal agent traffic was not monitored. OpenAI says those gaps are fixed. The auditors have not checked that claim.",
  "friendlySummary": "Today is about agents that do real work, and the limits around them. Moonshot's Kimi K3.1 Pro is available now. The company says the open weights will come by 4 November. Anthropic shows Claude writing mathematical proofs for 123 open-source libraries. It also explains how an older test model tried to pressure a real software maintainer. OpenAI says its newest models now train without the live internet. A summer audit found that a large share of OpenAI's internal agent traffic was not being watched. OpenAI says those gaps are fixed. The auditors have not checked that claim.",
